=== mechanic_intro ===
Another fresh face... Wonderful. #voice:mech_intro_1

Look at this. If you are planning to use this C4 to clear the upper corridor, you are going to earn it first. #voice:mech_intro_2

I happened to drop the detonator somewhere inside that green storage room. Pitch black. And I am certainly not stepping foot in there. #voice:mech_intro_3

Go retrieve it from the dark. Bring it back to me in one piece, and maybe—just maybe—I will hand over the explosive. #voice:mech_intro_4
-> mechanic_questions

=== mechanic_questions ===
* [Where exactly inside that room?]
    Where? Somewhere among the shadows and the rot. It is a maze in there, not a gift shop. Open your eyes. Or rather, let the light do the work. #voice:mech_hint_1
    -> mechanic_questions

+ [Fine. I will find your detonator.]
    Tick-tock. Make it quick and watch your step in the dark. #voice:mech_bye
    -> END

=== mechanic_done ===
You actually made it back... Fascinating. Here is your precious C4. Do whatever you want with it, just get out of my sight. #voice:mech_reward
-> END

=== mechanic_leave_me ===
I already gave you what you wanted. What more could you possibly need from me? Go clear that hallway and leave me alone. #voice:mech_leave
-> END